{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wF9ikIjU7N1794666397.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一年一度的藝趣嘉年華，晚上在銅鑼灣一帶舉行「夜光巡遊」。</p><p></p><p>國王在工作人員「攙扶」下，威風出巡，其他童話角色亦粉墨登場，在現實中邂逅觀眾，吸引不少人圍觀「打卡」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ARTPARK-2230.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rAfDZjzCE61794666412.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>超過150人組成的巡遊隊伍，途經恩平道、白沙道等，帶來舞蹈、銀樂隊等精彩表演。5個巨型燈籠玩偶，由本地藝術家所打造。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ARTPARK-2230_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uk72o5wvip1794666429.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有15年歷史的「藝趣嘉年華」，目的是透過藝術，為青少年提供學習和表演機會，除了木偶巡遊，亦一連兩日在維園擺放攤位及表演。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T14:46:41.554404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:43:00.807301+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T14:39:51.369251+00:00","content_hash":"8735afff4bc24a6eb283cd731a9a8ae2e3318e9939145694a0821903281eee07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T14:46:41.554404+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}